# No live MT5 connection exists in this project's Python side — the MT5 desktop app
# is macOS-native and historical data is pulled via the MQL5 exporter script
# (mql5/exporters/), not the Python `MetaTrader5` package. Execution is a native
# MQL5 Expert Advisor, not a Python bot. See mql5/ and ingestion/ for details.
#
# This file is a placeholder for credentials of any EXTERNAL data sources used for
# cross-asset features (e.g. a DXY/yields API), if one ends up being needed instead
# of pulling those symbols from MT5 itself. Populate only if/when such a source is added.

# EXTERNAL_MACRO_DATA_API_KEY=
